# Server-only non-secret configuration. Copy to functions/.env.<project-id>.
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-6-luna
# Emulator never calls OpenAI unless explicitly enabled (and a real key is present).
OPENAI_ALLOW_EMULATOR_LIVE=false
# Production secret: firebase functions:secrets:set OPENAI_API_KEY
# For intentional LIVE emulator calls only, put OPENAI_API_KEY in functions/.secret.local.
# Never put the key in EXPO_PUBLIC_*, app config, committed files, or this example.
# Emulator guard checks need no key: create an ignored functions/.secret.local with
# OPENAI_API_KEY= (empty) to avoid the CLI trying production Secret Manager.
# TTL: enable expiresAt only for _aiResults via Firestore TTL policies. Seven days.
# _aiRequests permanent digest/status tombstones MUST NOT have a TTL/deletion policy:
# deletion would permit a repeated requestId to trigger another billed call.
# _aiRateLimits daily counters expire logically at UTC day rollover; retained metadata.
# _aiBudget lifetime cap: 250 reservations x $0.02 = $5, never automatically refunded/reset.
# This is a reserved-attempt ceiling, NOT a guarantee of actual OpenAI/Firebase charges.
# Daily UTC reservation limits: authenticated UID 100/day, project 1000/day.
# Pending requests expire after 2 minutes. Completion cache expires after 7 days.
# Failed/pending/expired IDs are never auto-reissued; identical completed IDs replay cache.
# Different input with the same UID/requestId is rejected, including after cache expiry.
# Enable cache cleanup: gcloud firestore fields ttls update expiresAt --collection-group=_aiResults --enable-ttl
# Build: npm --prefix functions run build (also Firebase functions predeploy).
# Typecheck: npm --prefix functions run typecheck
# Optional deterministic edge tests: npm --prefix functions test
# Emulator (build first): firebase emulators:start --only auth,firestore,functions
# Deploy: firebase deploy --only functions:parseTransaction
# Provider: Responses API, reasoning none, max_output_tokens 512, store false,
# no tools, no SDK retries, timeout 25 seconds, image detail low. Region asia-southeast1.
# Runtime Node 22; function timeout 60s, 256MiB, maxInstances 5, concurrency 10.
# OPENAI_MODEL is restricted to gpt-6-luna; unsupported overrides fail closed.
# Official model verified 2026-11-14: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-luna
# Text+image inputs, Responses and structured_outputs, reasoning none are documented.
# Dates without a zone use Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh, missing dates use receivedAt (not server time).
# No raw text/images/provider errors are persisted/logged; only hashes, quota/status,
# timestamps and private structured completions. Existing Firestore rules deny clients.
# Emulator guards never substitute fake AI responses; live opt-in uses actual OpenAI.
# An operator must never delete/reset _aiRequests or _aiBudget to retry a failed call.
